Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:36.60,Song,,0,0,0,,{the song is "sarutobi sasuke" by Kamitakada Shounen Gasshoudan - released on https://www.discogs.com/release/20278822-%E5%B2%A9%E7%80%AC%E5%AF%9B-%E4%B8%8A%E9%AB%98%E7%94%B0%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%88%E5%94%B1%E5%9B%A3-%E4%B9%85%E5%9F%8E%E5%95%93%E5%AD%90-%E7%8C%BF%E9%A3%9B%E4%BD%90%E5%8A%A9-%E3%81%8A%E3%82%86%E3%81%86%E3%81%AE%E5%94%84 - by some miracle, vgmdb has lyrics booklet pics: https://vgmdb.net/album/100993}{力ょ力 雲に乗ってこい\N山の仲間は 猿 熊 仔鹿 おー\N胸に 友情\N瞳に 正義\Nやるぞ負けずに ついてこい\N僕は 少年猿飛佐助\N\Nのぞみよ のぞみ 虹をだいてこい\N若い血潮が クウクウさわぐ おい\Nくるか 山賊\Nこしゃくな嵐\Nやるぞ世のため人のため\N僕は 少年猿飛佐助\N\N勇気よ勇気 岩を蹴ってこい\Nえらくなるんだ 心のつよい おー\N右に姉さん\N左に努力\Nやるぞ 見てくれ 青い空\N僕は 少年猿飛佐助} Strength, O strength, come riding on the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:40.86,Song,,0,0,0,,My mountain friends are monkey, bear, and fawn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:47.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh, friendship in my heart, justice in my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:55.89,Song,,0,0,0,,We can do it! Don't give in, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:01:04.72,Song,,0,0,0,,I am young Sarutobi Sasuke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:05.98,Song,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiro!{the monkey}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.15,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kolo!{the big black bear}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Sister's calling.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The snacks are ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.85,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.09,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Kolo?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.41,0:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Eri. {the fawn}{dropping -chan / -san for this movie because a lot of the names don't sound japanese}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.73,0:05:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kolo, you can have that one.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here! What, you want this?{"kocchi he, kocchi da kocchi da, koko"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.38,0:05:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, throw it to me!{"oi, sore wa --"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.65,0:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.70,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.07,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hey! Give it back! Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.18,0:07:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kolo, he...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.01,0:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.06,0:08:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke! Sasuke, look at that!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri! This is bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.62,0:13:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.56,0:13:48.00,Thought,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.24,0:14:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As it happens, that woman is a witch.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.34,0:14:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,According to an old legend, \Nshe was always covetous of others' belongings.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.64,0:14:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone was even a little prettier\N or happier than she was,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.98,0:14:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,she'd grow jealous right away \Nand inevitably make that person's life miserable.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.53,0:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So the high priest of the time came all the way\N to that forest, guided by a deer.{/saint}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.73,0:14:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He promptly punished the witch\N with his holy powers,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.31,0:14:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,turning her into a giant salamander.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.58,0:14:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the high priest passed away,\N that salamander would sometimes return to her former shape,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.44,0:14:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and there are rumors she's been tormenting innocent people.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.76,0:15:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, it's got to be Princess Yasha! {yasha/yaksha are demons in buddhism, imma assume it's her proper name here}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.39,0:15:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis, I'm gonna learn ninjutsu! {ninja techniques}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll master it and beat her for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.39,0:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, you're too young for that.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.68,0:15:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But then... we'll continue living in fear!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.06,0:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.65,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's wait until you're a little older, all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.91,0:15:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.07,0:16:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.00,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri, go home now.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.02,0:17:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri, I said go home!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't follow me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take this and hurry home.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Eri!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it? {"ima jikan...", could go with "It's so late..."}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.70,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Jiro?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.56,0:19:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"Big Sis, I'm going to learn ninjutsu no matter what.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.82,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't come back until I've mastered it. \NDon't worry about me."
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.{"ah, sou da"}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.48,0:19:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is bad! Wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.18,0:19:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.70,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.41,0:19:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.18,0:19:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that boy makes up his mind,\N you can't reason with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.92,0:19:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{Please, may he live without a need in anything.}{/take him in wonderfully - w/e that means}May he fully master ninjutsu.{"douzo rippa ni shugyou dekimasu you"}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.53,0:19:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch over him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.55,0:20:05.98,Song,,0,0,0,,{We're a band with matching beards carrying our heavy booty}{山賊の歌 by フォア・コインズ - for some reason, wasn't included on the LP with two other songs, and it's also the toughest one of them... translating by ear but it's not pretty}We're a gang of hairy thugs, carrying our heavy booty{"higezura soroe", here lit. as "a group of unshaved (thugs)"}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.98,0:20:12.82,Song,,0,0,0,,{Bold and bawdy, raising our cups merrily}It's time to celebrate, let's all drink our fill{uttori iwai da sakamori da}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.79,0:20:26.78,Song,,0,0,0,,We're the bandits of Mt. Oyama \NWe're the bandits of Mt. Oyama{ye, it's a proper name}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.78,0:20:33.89,Song,,0,0,0,,{Packed chests and a thousand-ryo haul}Let's haul our thousand-ryo booty in chests full to bursting{tsuzura sakanaku sen-ryou hakobou}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.89,0:20:40.81,Song,,0,0,0,,{Line it all up, we're in high spirits}Line it all up, and rejoice at the sight
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.98,0:20:55.28,Song,,0,0,0,,We're the best on Mt. Oyama \NWe're the brightest on Mt. Oyama
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.30,0:21:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.49,0:21:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Sasuke! And who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.29,0:21:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Haven't you heard about Gonkuro of Yamanashi, \Nthe bandit unmatched under heaven?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.79,0:21:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandits? So you're just crooks \Nwith nothing good on your minds?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing good, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.22,0:21:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You insolent brat! Come down here, \Nand I'll give you a proper beating!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.89,0:21:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mouthy brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But not for long!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.78,0:21:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.66,0:21:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.27,0:21:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.00,0:21:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing! Gonkuro, defeated by a child!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.87,0:22:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Better now?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.71,0:22:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away from home in secret isn't the answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.46,0:22:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninjutsu's still way beyond a child like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.17,0:22:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know everything about me?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.96,0:22:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's written all over your face.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.85,0:22:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The hermit you seek lives atop \Nthe highest peak of Mt. Togakure.{戸隠山, a fitting name for a mountain retreat}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.88,0:22:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But with a child's legs, you'll never make the climb.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.21,0:23:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but for everyone's sake, I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,For everyone's sake!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.10,0:23:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.07,0:26:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:34.66,0:26:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Sasuke. You made it.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:38.28,0:26:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, mister?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:40.29,0:26:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:43.09,0:26:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the hermit you're looking for{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 10,0:26:45.72,0:26:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tozawa Hakuunsai. {yes, actually his name - https://mastergraywolf.fandom.com/wiki/Hakuunsai_Tozawa}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:48.66,0:26:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Sasuke, in light of your courage, \NI'll accept you as my disciple, starting today.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.56,0:26:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.64,0:27:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. From today on, you'll live here with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:43.60,0:27:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Sasuke? Can you feel yourself getting stronger?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:49.42,0:27:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.25,0:27:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,From tomorrow on, you'll be carrying those.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.38,0:28:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:07.83,0:28:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't say it hurts!}No complaints!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:09.58,0:28:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive because it was me, \Nbut what if I'd been an enemy?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:24.14,0:28:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's the spirit.\N Remember, keep your guard up at all times.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:30.52,0:28:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:32.21,0:28:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:32.96,0:28:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See? You were wide open.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:55.13,0:28:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho. Heave-ho.{yoisho dokkoisho}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.94,0:29:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiro, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:14.70,0:29:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure! See this?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:47.50,0:30:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:52.82,0:30:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!{a-ita}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:12.85,0:31:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No! Give it back! Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:54.48,0:31:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hold it, hold it, hold it! \NWhoa! Catch it! Catch it!{The spaces are needed to keep this readable lmao, perhaps use a different font?}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:57.17,0:32:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wriggling around and trying to get away! \NI caught it! Gotta hold it tight! Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.29,0:32:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:47.86,0:32:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sasuke. No trickery allowed.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:52.43,0:32:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Try again.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:11.05,0:33:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:44.59,0:33:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, how are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:47.88,0:33:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting to miss home yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:51.22,0:33:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:54.32,0:33:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:56.92,0:34:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Endure it just a little longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:00.18,0:34:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:03.04,0:34:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, what's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:10.60,0:34:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{The reflection of fire from the world below.}The glow of fire from the lowlands.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.16,0:34:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely the bandits are ravaging the town again.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:17.24,0:34:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandits?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:20.75,0:34:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Throughout history, evil always finds a way to thrive.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:47.49,0:34:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.25,0:34:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we come!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:51.42,0:34:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:57.23,0:34:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:00.52,0:35:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:09.34,0:35:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:10.47,0:35:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.78,0:35:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:12.25,0:35:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:12.92,0:35:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:18.55,0:35:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:25.98,0:35:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:29.00,0:35:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And pull!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.38,0:35:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Away with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.87,0:35:39.85,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch! {Sore! Deyou!}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:40.63,0:35:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you thieves!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:43.83,0:35:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Move it!{isoge, koi!}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:49.21,0:35:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here we come!{yoshi, kore}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:05.14,0:36:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord! My Lord! This is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:08.50,0:36:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:09.35,0:36:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The town is burning!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:10.88,0:36:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Ride out to the rescue!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:12.33,0:36:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:17.20,0:36:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts!{itai}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:21.89,0:36:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:30.56,0:36:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:31.94,0:36:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No, don't...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:32.90,0:36:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Scram, kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:34.72,0:36:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thieves! Thieves! Thieves! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:51.61,0:36:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Men! Retreat!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:55.57,0:36:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:57.17,0:36:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:07.50,0:37:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:48.63,0:37:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what,
Dialogue: 10,0:37:50.50,0:37:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we must find the bandits' hideout!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:02.30,0:38:09.02,Song,,0,0,0,,We're a gang of hairy thugs, carrying our heavy booty{same song as before}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:09.02,0:38:15.79,Song,,0,0,0,,It's time to celebrate, let's all drink our fill
Dialogue: 10,0:38:22.70,0:38:30.54,Song,,0,0,0,,We're the bandits of Mt. Oyama \NWe're the bandits of Mt. Oyama
Dialogue: 10,0:38:44.60,0:38:51.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's haul our thousand-ryo booty in chests full to bursting
Dialogue: 10,0:38:51.60,0:38:58.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Line it all up, and rejoice at the sight
Dialogue: 10,0:39:06.04,0:39:13.81,Song,,0,0,0,,We're the best on Mt. Oyama \NWe're the brightest on Mt. Oyama
Dialogue: 10,0:39:28.18,0:39:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:33.35,0:39:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here. You eat this, and then get lost, got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:37.31,0:39:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Until you give my chest back, \NI'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:42.82,0:39:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You d-damn stubborn girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:45.84,0:39:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's a fearsome lady \Nhere called Princess Yasha.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:52.57,0:39:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:53.79,0:39:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she {\i1}that{\i0} ugly?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:59.84,0:40:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonkuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:01.67,0:40:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That Yukimura's bound to come after us. {the lord from earlier, I assume}
Dialogue: 10,0:40:05.26,0:40:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've posted lookouts, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:07.61,0:40:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh? Well, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:09.37,0:40:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:11.31,0:40:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cretin!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:11.89,0:40:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please, just go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:16.84,0:40:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out you're here, we're d-done for.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:22.40,0:40:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? But that's not my problem!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:30.58,0:40:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji! Kinta!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:39.12,0:40:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:42.80,0:40:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:50.84,0:40:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:53.04,0:40:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, n-nothing in particular. Right, Kinta?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:56.93,0:41:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing in particular. Right, Sanji?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:01.58,0:41:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That Yukimura's definitely coming after us.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:04.86,0:41:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys kept a proper lookout, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:07.70,0:41:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{Well, we were actually done for the day...}Sir, we were about to go on watch!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:10.29,0:41:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop slacking off, you idiots!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:37.69,0:41:47.45,Song,,0,0,0,,{song of Oyuu, was on LP, full lyrics found: 信濃の御山は高こうてもナ 信濃の谷間は深こうてもナ 小鳥になれたらとべように お猿になれたら渡ろうに きりや、かすみのか、らぬうちによ こんこん小雪がとけだしてナ ちらほら椿の咲く頃はナ 御山の娘のこの夢を もたせてやりたや、山彦に 山の向うの若殿さまによ みどりの峠で逢うたらナ もみじのふもとで逢うたらナ 御国の唄でも聞かそうに 御城の話もき、たいに 今日のあの空慕うて唄うよ} Though the mountains of Shinano are high, oh so high
Dialogue: 10,0:41:47.45,0:41:56.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Though the valleys of Shinano run deep, oh so deep
Dialogue: 10,0:41:56.60,0:42:05.73,Song,,0,0,0,,If I could become a little bird, I would fly across
Dialogue: 10,0:42:05.73,0:42:15.03,Song,,0,0,0,,If I could become a monkey, I would make my way over
Dialogue: 10,0:42:15.03,0:42:27.40,Song,,0,0,0,,Before the mist and haze have cleared away
Dialogue: 10,0:42:30.07,0:42:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{My Lord, such a rare beauty in this mountain village...}My Lord, she's so beautiful for one \Nborn and raised in these mountains.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:38.84,0:42:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, have you seen anyone \Nresembling bandits around here?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:46.08,0:42:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the young master of Ueda Castle, \NLord Sanada Yukimura. {yes, the one from the ten braves of sanada}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:50.01,0:42:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My...{ma...}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:51.30,0:42:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am his retainer, Miyoshi Seikai Nyudo.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:54.57,0:42:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you live nearby and don't mind the hassle,\N could you serve my lord some tea?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:59.39,0:43:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly. It's just a humble shack, \Nbut you're welcome regardless.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:58.63,0:43:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinta?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:05.33,0:44:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard the bandits' hideout lies \Nsomewhere in those faraway mountains.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:32.11,0:44:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These are good!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:34.45,0:44:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna eat them all!{minna tabechau wa}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:42.54,0:44:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So when did Sasuke leave home?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:46.37,0:44:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been three years.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:49.13,0:44:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he's doing now.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:55.46,0:45:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sasuke, you've become quite an impressive ninja.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:00.22,0:45:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we try that one more time?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:08.12,0:45:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:10.19,0:45:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, let's do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:38.68,0:45:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, I'm back.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:41.67,0:45:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become remarkably nimble.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:45.28,0:45:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Oyuu, when Sasuke returns, \Nplease tell him to come see me.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:49.46,0:45:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:50.68,0:45:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I shall come again.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:53.24,0:45:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall be awaiting you.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:17.88,0:48:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:19.86,0:48:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:20.86,0:48:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:22.80,0:48:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No one dares to interrupt my dance! {lit: if you ... you'll regret it}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:24.51,0:48:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but something important came up. {lit: it's not the time for that}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:27.39,0:48:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lookouts have spotted Yukimura.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:29.59,0:48:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:32.18,0:48:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. In the mountains, at that hut, with a beautiful girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:35.43,0:48:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A beautiful girl, you say?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:38.40,0:48:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you report this sooner?!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:40.44,0:48:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:42.56,0:48:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I learned earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:45.05,0:48:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently that girl's little brother \Nis studying ninjutsu under Hakuunsai.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:50.12,0:48:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninjutsu?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:52.12,0:48:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the boy's name?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:54.92,0:48:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was Sasuke or something...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:58.13,0:49:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, you say?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:09.43,0:49:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat from before?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:15.19,0:49:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:18.05,0:49:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonkuro.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:19.40,0:49:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To think we've let those sorts of people\N live in our mountains...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:24.07,0:49:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninjutsu, he says! A beautiful girl, he says! \NThe young master of Ueda Castle!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:29.57,0:49:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word of it makes my blood boil!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:34.07,0:49:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it, this irritates me no end!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:38.08,0:49:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them off at once. Understood?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:40.72,0:49:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:44.92,0:49:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you lot! Move out!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:58.00,0:49:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oyuu's in deep trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:05.99,0:50:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:10.70,0:50:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiro, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:11.88,0:50:13.30,Overlap,,0,0,0,,The bandits are coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:21.38,0:50:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:22.40,0:50:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:23.25,0:50:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:35.58,0:50:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone. Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:06.59,0:51:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where's the girl?!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:08.61,0:51:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! They're escaping!{ah, anna tokoro ni}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:14.18,0:51:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch them! Catch them!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:31.11,0:51:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-They're coming this way! {kocchi kite ni nacchatta}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:38.60,0:51:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{kocchi kita kita kita}They're already here!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:56.68,0:51:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{saa minna kite --}Get up there, quick!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:11.07,0:52:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:22.62,0:52:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:52.44,0:52:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:56.28,0:52:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You called for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:57.11,0:52:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time, Sasuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:59.70,0:53:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must descend the mountain at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:03.62,0:53:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:04.46,0:53:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the time for your first trial has come.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:09.87,0:53:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you descend, all will become clear.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:13.34,0:53:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall also meet the noble man \Nwhom you shall serve in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:46.58,0:53:51.12,Song,,0,0,0,,{sasuke's song, inserted lyrics before} Hope, O hope, come cradling the rainbow
Dialogue: 10,0:53:51.12,0:53:55.30,Song,,0,0,0,,Young blood surges, pounding wild
Dialogue: 10,0:53:55.30,0:53:59.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh! Will Princess Yasha come?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:59.55,0:54:01.82,Song,,0,0,0,,Let the impudent storm rage
Dialogue: 10,0:54:01.82,0:54:09.66,Song,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, for the good of society and all mankind
Dialogue: 10,0:54:09.66,0:54:18.13,Song,,0,0,0,,I am young Sarutobi Sasuke
Dialogue: 10,0:54:18.13,0:54:19.32,Song,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:24.12,0:54:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand, every pretty girl here\N ends up getting killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:30.06,0:54:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, how scary.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:32.12,0:54:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you're trying to chase me away?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:36.56,0:54:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch, this is hopeless. Don't get smart with us! {maseteyagaru na}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:42.51,0:54:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, cut us a break already!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:47.56,0:54:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't head home now—ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:50.52,0:54:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll tie you to this rock and toss you into the ravine.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:58.61,0:55:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Humph. Like you could pull that off.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:03.49,0:55:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kinta...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:06.08,0:55:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:10.37,0:55:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we toss her down with our eyes closed?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:13.38,0:55:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we aren't looking.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:16.55,0:55:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:18.68,0:55:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought this upon yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:19.84,0:55:22.18,Overlap,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:20.34,0:55:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've been more reasonable.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:22.72,0:55:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two!{kore, kora}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:24.80,0:55:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, man?{saa te, iku zo}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:26.47,0:55:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn rascal!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:26.47,0:55:29.62,Overlap,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to me?!{yancha no + iiya, nani wo suru}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:40.45,0:55:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleh!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:45.20,0:55:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:50.58,0:55:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:52.43,0:55:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:53.66,0:55:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:55.52,0:55:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard! {you did it didn't you}
Dialogue: 10,0:56:00.92,0:56:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:02.62,0:56:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! That hurt, dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:07.18,0:56:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:08.16,0:56:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:17.82,0:56:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we've come far enough to be safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:21.06,0:56:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:24.28,0:56:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! You scared me!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:26.99,0:56:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:29.63,0:56:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm the great ninjutsu master, Sarutobi Sasuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:34.29,0:56:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a master?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:37.46,0:56:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yep, I've got a license as well.}Yep, I'm fully proficient.{免許皆伝}
Dialogue: 10,0:56:39.77,0:56:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, only half of what I told you is true.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:42.13,0:56:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. Something seemed off.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:44.78,0:56:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't much older than me.{hanatare kozou, lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:56:47.63,0:56:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you're really a ninja, \Nthen get my chest back from those bandits.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:53.20,0:56:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Bandits?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:54.97,0:56:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but first, you've gotta meet my sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:58.81,0:57:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You've got a sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:01.24,0:57:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I do! She's the sweetest sister ever.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:04.65,0:57:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My! I'd love to meet her.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:07.99,0:57:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, wanna come with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:09.66,0:57:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:30.22,0:57:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it much farther?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:32.60,0:57:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired already.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:34.72,0:57:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just about see my hut from here.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:50.36,0:57:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:51.09,0:57:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:03.09,0:58:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:54.64,0:58:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:57.26,0:58:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:00.98,0:59:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:09.04,0:59:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:17.54,0:59:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Eri!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:23.04,0:59:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri, where's Oyuu?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:31.98,0:59:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:33.33,0:59:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:37.10,0:59:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:46.24,0:59:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:49.72,0:59:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown so much...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:51.13,0:59:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. Sorry I left without a word, Sis.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:00.16,1:00:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sasuke, you must go \Nto Lord Yukimura's castle at once.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:04.06,1:00:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:12.47,1:00:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone there?! {/hello}
Dialogue: 10,1:00:15.88,1:00:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Sasuke! I've come to see Lord Yukimura!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:18.72,1:00:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Humph! What nonsense!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:21.18,1:00:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize where you are?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:23.57,1:00:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:25.77,1:00:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let a kid push me around! {ye, this works}
Dialogue: 10,1:00:27.23,1:00:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:32.05,1:00:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one shady brat.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:34.81,1:00:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down here!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:37.28,1:00:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Gatekeeper! I'll pass through,\Nwith or without your permission!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:46.71,1:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:49.42,1:00:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord Seikai. That kid over there...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:56.51,1:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:58.86,1:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:19.70,1:01:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:30.96,1:01:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you, Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:38.80,1:01:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, well done making it here.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:41.05,1:01:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw through my ninjutsu.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:43.30,1:01:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yukimura, you're every bit as impressive as Sis told me.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:48.27,1:01:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how is Lady Oyuu?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:50.77,1:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've come.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:52.90,1:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The bandits burned down our hut.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:54.76,1:01:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's resting in a cave now.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:56.78,1:01:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The bandits?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:58.29,1:01:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:59.25,1:02:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My lord! A suspicious boy just flew into your castle...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:02.96,1:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:04.12,1:02:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seikai, what are you saying? \NThis is Sasuke, Lady Oyuu's younger brother.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:09.21,1:02:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandits burned their home.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:10.85,1:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That girl's house?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:13.00,1:02:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:13.70,1:02:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We ride to the mountains at once!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:15.15,1:02:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:53.89,1:02:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:03.99,1:03:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sis!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:05.14,1:03:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:06.89,1:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be an offering for Princess Yasha.{lib.}
Dialogue: 10,1:03:12.54,1:03:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis! Sis!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:16.69,1:03:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:29.18,1:03:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Oyuu's comb.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:34.94,1:03:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, Lady Oyuu's in danger!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:55.52,1:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I know you're Sasuke's sister, \NI won't let you off easily.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:05.34,1:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That pretty face of yours...\NI'll make sure no one can bear to look at it!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:23.44,1:04:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, scout around back.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:27.18,1:04:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the front.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:28.61,1:04:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:36.36,1:04:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, take me with you!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:39.11,1:04:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get in the way!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:40.99,1:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:44.33,1:04:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait here with the others. {Hokei}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:46.88,1:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll signal you later.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:48.47,1:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. You need to stay here and issue orders.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:52.02,1:04:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm in command?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:54.58,1:04:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I guess I can stay.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:22.99,1:05:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:24.30,1:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:01.27,1:06:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:14.28,1:06:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{tsubushite kure, konna no yacchimae}Carve them up and be done with it!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:16.70,1:06:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{omae wa}Found them!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:17.47,1:06:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{Seikai, kakugo no ue wo, yousha wa iran zo}Steel yourself, Seikai. Don't show any mercy!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:19.79,1:06:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them to me! {makashita}
Dialogue: 10,1:06:20.62,1:06:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done waiting!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:24.79,1:06:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:31.92,1:06:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're all leaving! Wake up! Wake up!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:45.69,1:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:48.70,1:06:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:23.21,1:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:24.92,1:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:26.61,1:07:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:28.24,1:07:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:34.33,1:07:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:39.60,1:07:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,1:07:55.35,1:07:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,1:07:57.10,1:07:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you bum!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:34.76,1:08:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come. {kita na}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:39.06,1:08:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the proverbial moths drawn to the flame.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:43.52,1:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 10,1:08:45.36,1:08:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Gonkuro.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:46.83,1:08:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:14.43,1:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding my sister?!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:17.15,1:09:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't talk?
Dialogue: 10,1:09:18.38,1:09:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:19.78,1:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to smack you again?
Dialogue: 10,1:09:21.62,1:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A-All right, all right! Th-The Octagon Hall!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:24.56,1:09:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, the Octagon Hall!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:50.02,1:09:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:56.51,1:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:58.76,1:09:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:00.34,1:10:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you hide my sister?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:02.09,1:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to know?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:07.27,1:10:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you see for yourself, so watch closely.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:09.39,1:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonkuro!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:17.68,1:10:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:19.36,1:10:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:32.23,1:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:33.46,1:10:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, cease your resistance if you value Oyuu's life.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:51.06,1:10:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:53.73,1:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously think yourself capable of harming me?
Dialogue: 10,1:11:14.08,1:11:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:29.89,1:11:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:08.20,1:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Try me!{"kisama"}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:15.65,1:12:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:18.09,1:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:39.51,1:12:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:41.53,1:12:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! He dares?!{"ah, anego", paraphrased}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:44.09,1:12:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it, you brat! Cut the rope!{kiriotose}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:47.93,1:12:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:15.84,1:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:26.59,1:13:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:28.70,1:13:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:29.49,1:13:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:30.05,1:13:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get 'em!{"hikitsuzuki da"}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:32.28,1:13:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn thugs!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:56.04,1:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!{this works}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:58.50,1:13:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through!{"un-to da"}
Dialogue: 10,1:14:06.01,1:14:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{"sawagu na"}Keep your hands off me!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:15.39,1:14:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bring it on!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:35.33,1:14:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I-If only I could reach my club...
Dialogue: 10,1:14:45.75,1:14:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:49.47,1:14:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:51.22,1:14:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 10,1:14:56.66,1:15:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you damn brat! Stop! {yarou, chikusho, mate kore}
Dialogue: 10,1:15:00.09,1:15:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:01.99,1:15:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:03.77,1:15:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you...
Dialogue: 10,1:15:06.67,1:15:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!{"ei kuso"}
Dialogue: 10,1:15:08.78,1:15:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:13.78,1:15:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:17.32,1:16:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:53.64,1:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Oyuu!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:38.34,1:21:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasuke, thanks to you, everyone can finally live in peace.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:44.55,1:21:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Sasuke?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:46.49,1:21:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you come to Ueda Castle and serve under me?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:50.06,1:21:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still just a kid.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:56.10,1:21:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:58.86,1:22:03.52,Song,,0,0,0,,{same as twice before} Courage, O courage, come kick the rocks aside
Dialogue: 10,1:22:03.52,1:22:07.86,Song,,0,0,0,,I'll rise to greatness, strong of heart
Dialogue: 10,1:22:07.86,1:22:14.80,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh! With Big Sister on the right, and effort on the left
Dialogue: 10,1:22:14.80,1:22:23.20,Song,,0,0,0,,We can do it! Just look up at the blue sky!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:23.20,1:22:32.20,Song,,0,0,0,,I am young Sarutobi Sasuke
Dialogue: 10,1:22:32.20,1:22:33.20,Song,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
